<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysian Pacific year net up 62 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysian Pacific year net up 62 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>		     (In million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		93.80    vs	 57.76</p>
<p>    Shr	    (cents)  45.3     vs	 29.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (pct)	  20.0     vs	 16.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		 882.47    vs	 611.34</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	 134.76    vs	 88.49</p>
<p>    Minorities	 less 37.46    vs  less 21.90</p>
<p>NOTE: Malaysian Pacific Industries Bhd is a manufacturing concern, with semiconductor and packaging operations.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
